      "core_meaning_cn": "通过“发出称呼/联系/要求”来触达对象：可命名、打电话、要求/呼吁；名词还可表示电话、拜访或召唤",
      "core_meaning_en": "to reach or designate someone/something by naming, telephoning, demanding, or summoning; as a noun, a phone call, visit, or summons",
      "mental_model_cn": "call sb sth → 称呼；call sb → 打电话；call for sth / call on sb to do → 要求/呼吁；call off → 取消；noun call → 电话/拜访/召唤。 声音、呼救、喊名字语境也可直接指喊叫或呼唤，不能一律读作打电话。",
      "mental_model_en": "Let the complement and particle select naming, telephoning, demand, cancellation, or noun event."
